# Railway upload filter for `railway up` — token-driven CD (scripts/holo-ci/cd-railway.mjs).
#
# CRITICAL: `railway up` filters the UPLOADED build context by THIS file — NOT by
# .gitignore and NOT by .dockerignore. If the multi-GB agent/bench dirs are not
# excluded here, `railway up` uploads them and buildkit OOM-crashes (.scratch alone
# is ~12GB; its absence here ballooned the context to 1.8GB+ and crashed buildkit —
# see .dockerignore:11-15 / P.002). The GitHub App never hit this because it ships a
# `git archive` (tracked files only).
#
# MUST NOT exclude paths a build needs: infrastructure/ holds the Dockerfiles
# (e.g. infrastructure/Dockerfile.mcp-server referenced by railway.toml), scripts/
# holds build scripts (scripts/docker/**), and package/service sources +
# pnpm-lock.yaml + pnpm-workspace.yaml are all required. Keep the heavy-dir
# exclusions below in sync with .dockerignore when those dirs change.

# VCS / deps / build caches (regenerated inside the build)
node_modules
.git
.turbo
.cache
.next
coverage
dist

# Multi-GB agent worktrees + bench/output — THE root cause of the buildkit OOM
.scratch/
.bench-logs/
quantum_receipts/
target/
datasets/
.ai-workspace/
.ai-context-stream.jsonl

# Logs / AI-ML artifacts / test reports (not needed in any build context)
*.log
*.jsonl
training_audit.csv
synthetic_*.txt
audit-results/
.performance-reports/
.stryker-tmp/
.stryker-cache/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Secrets — never upload
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.secrets/

# Local daemon / IDE / OS state
.holoscript/
.holomesh/
.gitnexus/
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Misc temp / build artifacts
*.tmp
tmp/
temp/
*.vsix
packages/video-tutorials/out/
packages/video-tutorials/public/narration/
packages/video-tutorials/public/captures/
packages/tree-sitter-holoscript/build/
packages/tauri-app/src-tauri/gen/
